hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"72","[AI-translation] Usama ibn Zayd (Allah amridhie) amesema kutoka kwa Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) kwamba amesema: Tauni ilitajwa mbele ya Nabii (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam), basi akasema: ((Tauni ni adhabu iliyoteremshwa, au taifa miongoni mwa mataifa ya kabla yenu liliadhibiwa kwayo, nayo ni mabaki yake. Mkisikia kwamba tauni imetokea nchi, msiende huko, na ikitokea nchi mliyomo, msikimbie humo)). Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir akasema: Nilimsimulia Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz hadithi hii, akasema: Amir ibn Sa'd (Allah amrehemu) aliniambia hadithi hii kwa namna ile ile."
"73","[AI-translation] Usama ibn Zayd (Allah amridhie) anasimulia kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) amesema: ((Tauni ni adhabu iliyoteremshwa kwa watu wa kabla yenu au kwa Wana wa Israil. Tauni inapienea nchi, msiende huko, na inapienea nchi mnayoishi, msitoke humo))."
"74","[AI-translation] Ibrahim ibn Abdillah aliniambia hadithi, akasema: Muhammad ibn Hafs alitusimulia, akasema: Baba yangu alitusimulia kutoka kwa Shaybani, akasema: Habib ibn Abi Thabit aliniambia kutoka kwa Ibrahim ibn Sa'd, akasimulia hivi kisha akasimulia hadithi mfano wa hadithi iliyotangulia."
"75","[AI-translation] Ibrahim aliniambia hadithi, akasema: Umar ibn Hafs alitusimulia, akasema: Baba yangu alitusimulia, kutoka kwa Shaybani, kutoka kwa Abu Bakr, kwamba Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz aliniambia kutoka kwa Amir ibn Sa'd, mfano wa hadithi iliyotangulia. Wapokezi wote wanataja hadithi kupitia Usama ibn Zayd (Allah amridhie)."
"76","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Abdillah ibn Abd ar-Rahman kwamba Amir ibn Sa'd alimsimulia Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (Allah amrehemu) alipokuwa gavana wa Madina. Sa'd ibn Malik (Allah amridhie) alimuarifu kwamba hakika Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) amesema: Yule atakayekula tende saba za ajwa kutoka eneo baina ya miamba miwili meusi ya Madina, na akaanza siku yake nazo, sumu haitamdhuru siku hiyo mpaka usiku. Amir ibn Sa'd aliambiwa na Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz: Ewe Amir! Angalia unachomnasibishia Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam)! Amir akajibu: Nashuhudia kwamba sikumzulia Sa'd ibn Malik (Allah amridhie), wala Sa'd (Allah amridhie) hakumzulia Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam). Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz (Allah amrehemu) akasema: Nami nashuhudia kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) hakusema uongo."
